<BlogPostLayout
  title="Proof in Production: Evaluating Effectiveness of SWE Agents with A/B Tests"
  description="SWE-Agents are setting new benchmark records, yet underperform in the real world. Beneath the hype, only A/B testing can prove their effectiveness."
  date="May 2025"
